Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add BlackBerry 10 (Q10) device

Probed on QNX (ffi.os POSIX + /pps/services); bb10 framebuffer/input
from base, battery via BPS, navigator exit/minimize handling, Q10 key
map, shell launcher (platform/bb10/koreader.sh).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
